<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="section-hero case-study">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-hero fr-1-15">
            <div class="left-hero max-664">
              <div class="gap-4">
                <div wb-component="smart-animate" class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2">
                  <a href="#" class="text-caps">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps">Planful</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">This wasn’t just about a fresh logo; it was about crafting a brand and digital presence that matched their ambition, stood out in the competitive AI space, and resonated with their target audience.</div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">Through close collaboration and iterative feedback, we partnered with them to launch their new identity and create a powerful foundation for growth, ensuring their brand reflected their evolution and their goals as a startup.</div>
                <div wb-component="smart-animate" class="w-layout-vflex gap-0 wrap">
                  <h1 class="h1 inline"><span class="span-pink-2">12 Month of partnership:</span> Creating a video marketing plan that scales.</h1>
                </div>
                <div wb-split-type="lines" wb-component="split-text" class="text-16-150 color-white-80">When Planful approached us in late 2024, the goal was clear, <strong>&quot;to create a video marketing plan that could drive long-term growth&quot;</strong>. Over the next <a href="/pricing/design-subscription-services" class="link-40">12 months</a>, we rolled out a full creative strategy that included making animated assets that represented their brands, creating short videos for the <strong>Perform25</strong> event, producing content for the <strong>Meet The CFO</strong> podcast, and supporting their new <strong>AI Lab</strong> launch with cohesive storytelling across all channels.</div>
