          <div wb-split-type="lines" wb-component="split-text" class="text-16-150 color-white-80">Here’s a glimpse of what we’ve created for Planful so far — from <a href="/services/social-media" class="link-43">UGC videos </a>and explainer content to animation assets and branded motion design. Throughout this case study, we’ll dive deeper into how we approached creating a video marketing plan, the results achieved so far, and how Planful has responded to the work.</div>
