              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba87" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What was included in Planful’s 12-month creative subscription?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba8b" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Just like any of our subscription projects, we built a dedicated team around Planful’s needs. Our support covered everything from ideation and storyboarding to script writing and full content production — all the way through to ready-to-publish video marketing assets.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba91" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What types of video assets were created in the Planful project?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba95" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We produced a variety of marketing videos across Planful’s brands. This included launch trailers for the Perform25 event and AI Labs rollout, short podcast clips for social media, and a brand explainer video for Planful. Beyond publish-ready videos, we also created custom MOGRTs and lower-thirds to keep their internal team’s future edits consistent and on-brand.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba9b" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How many video and motion graphic assets were produced during the 12-month subscription?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcba9f" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We created over 100 animation assets for Planful, covering everything from event trailers and explainer videos to social media content and animated countdowns. Each piece was designed to align with their video marketing plan and support different stages of the user journey.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcbaa4" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What is a video marketing plan, and why do brands need one?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="0ebbd9f8-786c-9cee-e463-88bd79fcbaa8" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">A video marketing plan is a strategy that helps brands create content with purpose and consistency. Through our creative subscription model, we help clients plan and produce marketing videos each month, keeping every piece aligned, on-brand, and results-driven.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What are the benefits of having a video marketing plan versus producing videos ad hoc?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="be45694b-6333-5303-f830-e3ab652df451" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">A video marketing plan is a strategy that helps brands create content with purpose and consistency. Through our creative subscription model, we help clients plan and produce marketing videos each month, keeping every piece aligned, on-brand, and results-driven.</p>
